    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbd428d16630c031535da7c5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对不起，我刚才一时失态，\n惊扰到大家了。\n还害工作人员为我担心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ce54b03616a4d2652e282e642bf0aafa85e6b693dec08e8c9fb158cee4145b",
