    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a453b67679a1570d8720e6a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……所以，还请大家继续见证我的成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8252bf00218d98490abf3d1b18b0db2e3f1d8643e0b759f4b0880138100a9571",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ed6758ffd055244b7c49e86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "川上公主真心诚意地\n对镜头另一端的观众们表达自身决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e175fd758250dcc188c59532d6bc681264d5400024c546d960b9e0e46d7a8c9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc255baba6bf3603e459e024",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……听说节目收到多达70件来自观众的抗议。\n我知道这件事后也主动联络节目制作人，\n表达歉意……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2491827f20ddba9c513df9a176d744a0991084ad5b2e81fa08d406d0f49aca67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        76,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/76/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:522781bec6ad884cf78a744a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "制作人回说\n“我希望你们别太把这件事放在心上。\n我们以后也一样是川上公主的粉丝”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "607748758c215484273c21d13ce20b6a9719025f47843eaf5fe43157a85c3395",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:366df5578f5ea9773f9496b0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──她现在首要的目标是“金鯱赏”。\n我想要帮助她成为\n到时候可以真心为自己感到骄傲的公主。",
      "source_fingerprint": "039f580268a16879e3eaa002cf7eb20add8eac1df13fb9993e1bc1a5f1e853c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1039/storytimeline_501039116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
